N('Hangi cümle doğru?','If only she were here now.','Şimdiki gerçek dışı: If only + were.',{'If only she is here now.':'If only sonrası Present Simple gelmez; were gerekir.','If only she would be here yesterday.':'would geçmişle kullanılmaz; yesterday için had been gerekir.'}),
